# Build scratch. Every paper's LaTeX source is kept in paper-sources/, banded by rank, so the
# build tree itself is regenerable working state and is not stored: it held 35 660 files,
# including a duplicate PDF of every paper and LaTeX's .aux/.out droppings.
engine/build/
engine/build_*/
engine/papers-ranked/

# The `was`-keyed master. The same PDFs as papers/ under different names; restore_master.py
# rebuilds it exactly from papers/ and rank-map.json, verified byte for byte.
engine/papers-old-numbering/

# Downloaded OEIS b-files. A cache, refetchable, 145 MB.
engine/bcache/

# Delivery archives are no longer produced; the papers live in papers/.
conjecture-papers-*.zip

*.log
*.pids
*.bak
__pycache__/
